{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026F2nu7deOoq1794811951.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中原地產元朗區域營業經理王勤學表示，入市氣氛持續活躍，優質大單位備受用家垂青。元朗爾巒新近錄得珍諾華大道6座低層A室成交，單位實用面積774平方呎，三房套房連多用途房間隔，議價後以835.78萬元成交，實用呎價10798元。<br/>王勤學表示，買家為換樓客，見單位質素高，加上北部都會區前景優越，故睇樓後快速承接作新居。原業主於2014年3月以632萬元一手買入單位，持貨約12年，賬面賺203.78萬元，升值32%。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T06:29:32.030848+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":206,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T05:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T09:37:13.668410+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T06:22:53.238229+00:00","content_hash":"261221e6ef751fec852ec2400e9046a83760fa4200c5b9e47519dcf3eb8b22c2","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-17T06:29:32.030848+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}